1 & Forward: GZ Curvature & $\mathrm{Ric}_\infty(\Omega) \ge 2\gamma_G^2 = K_{\mathrm{QCD}} > 0$ & $< 10^{-12}$ & \textbf{PASS} \\
2 & Forward: Bakry-\'Emery Poincaré & Witten-Laplacian spectrum $\lambda_1(\mathcal{L}) \ge K_{\mathrm{QCD}}$ & $< 10^{-6}$ & \textbf{PASS} \\
3 & Forward: Spectral Flow & Monotonic flow $d_s(0)=4 \to d_s(\infty)=2$ & $< 10^{-3}$ & \textbf{PASS} \\
4 & Forward: Microcausality & Non-local scaling $(\mu/\Lambda_{\mathrm{UV}})^{2\alpha} \to 0$ & $< 10^{-3}$ & \textbf{PASS} \\
5 & Forward: Reach Flux Tube & String tension $\sigma = \frac{\pi}{2}(\kappa^*)^2 > 0$ & $< 10^{-4}$ & \textbf{PASS} \\
6 & Forward: Floer Vacuum & $\theta=0$ minimization $E(\theta) \ge E(0)$ & $< 10^{-12}$ & \textbf{PASS} \\
\midrule
7 & Inverse: Gribov AM-GM & Operator inequality $x + \gamma^4/x \ge 2\gamma^2$ & $< 10^{-12}$ & \textbf{PASS} \\
8 & Inverse: Savvidy Ensembles & Random magnetic perturbation $\mathcal{H}_{\mathrm{eff}} > 0$ & $< 10^{-10}$ & \textbf{PASS} \\
9 & Inverse: RG Reconstruction & Inversion of mass gap to $\Lambda_{\overline{\mathrm{MS}}}$ & $< 10^{-10}$ & \textbf{PASS} \\
10 & Inverse: Reach Inversion & Reach reconstruction from lattice tension $\sigma$ & $< 10^{-4}$ & \textbf{PASS} \\
11 & Inverse: Floer Spectrum & Truncated Hamiltonian matrix diagonalization & $< 0.05$ & \textbf{PASS} \\
12 & Inverse: RG Suppression Flow & Wilsonian irrelevance across 12 orders & $< 10^{-2}$ & \textbf{PASS} \\
